  "description": "Run by an analyst on an alert to scan a URL. Submits the URL set on 'VMRay: Submit URL' (the harmless EICAR test file by default) to VMRay without blocking, checks the analysis after 2, 6 and 14 minutes (Wait + Get Submission Result), posts the full report with screenshots as alert comments, pushes the IOCs to an IOC collection and lists the suspicious or malicious child samples. Consumes VMRay quota. Before use: select your VMRay1 account on the VMRay1 nodes and set ioc_collection_id on 'Add IOCs to IOC Collection'.",
